etained:\", df_comercial.shape[0])\n\n    if \"Order Id\" in df_comercial.columns:\n        print(\"Orders retained:\", df_comercial[\"Order Id\"].nunique())\n\n    print(\n        \"Rows removed:\",\n        df.shape[0] - df_comercial.shape[0]\n    )\n\nprint()\nprint(\"Reproducibility check completed.\")"
